  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.TigrisOASIS v2.0.3\n\nTigris Globally Distributed S3-Compatible Object Storage Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 9 new providers — 202 total (+restaking, +sequencing, +edge storage, +identity) (b9c9d9d)\n- feat: implement real API/SDK for all new providers (21 providers across 6 categories) (0d09c71)\n- feat(TigrisOASIS): full storage contract on Tigris S3 via the AWS SDK (62c8ae1)\n- Restore clean provider builds and integration startup (be39ecd)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.TigrisOASIS",
